  "description": "When you ride without limits, the Extreme is the only bike that’ll keep up. We’ve upped the ante on this proven series this year, with more travel and stronger frames. We borrowed the Werx 7’s bomber frame for the Extreme X3, featuring a 1.5-inch head tube, hydroformed top tube and a stunning 7 inches of rear travel. The Extreme X2 and X1 feature last year’s proven frame and hydroformed top tube, but with a redesigned swingarm that’s lighter and stronger, and offers 5 or 6 inches of adjustable travel. Up front, Extremes feature long-travel forks with oversize stanchions for big-hit performance and laser-guided control over any terrain. Take it to the limit, with confidence. Take it on the Extreme.",
